.max), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping ","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV"},{"text":" = { Date.now })","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where each record is kept until it is delivered."}]}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The user’s consent, which each event’s category must have before it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written and delivered; ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", every event delivered, by default.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"consent"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What each event’s context gains, applied in order by the tracker’s worker."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"enrichers"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which events, or groups of events, to keep a fraction of, decided by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s worker after the enrichers and before the store; none by default, so every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event is kept."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"samplers"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The seed the samplers’ decisions come from: fix it and which events are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"kept is fixed too. Drawn from the system’s random number generator once, as the tracker","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is made, by default. Fix it only in tests and replays: every launch with the same seed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes the same decision for its first matching event, its second and so on, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fixed seed shipped to every device keeps the same events everywhere rather than the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampler’s rate of them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"samplingSeed"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wall-clock time each event is stamped with when it is tracked. It runs on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking caller’s thread, so keep it fast."}]}],"name":"now"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker writes each record as it reaches it, before publishing it to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"text":", rather than a stage reading ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"text":", which runs in the delivery’s task,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later, perhaps after a slow batch. Given ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"consent"},{"text":", a record is written once its category","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is granted, not while it is held, and the recovered records are gated again. The worker","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes the recovered records from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"text":" before anything tracked.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Given ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"samplers"},{"text":", a record they drop is never written. A record the store recovered was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampled in the run that wrote it, so it isn’t sampled again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentati